  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we offer this personalized blanket designed to bring comfort and inspiration, making it a perfect gift for Christian women. Customize it with a name or text for a truly unique and meaningful present.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Christian Gift:</strong> A perfect personalized gift combining faith, love, and comfort, ideal for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Customization:</strong> Select your preferred design and add a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind meaningful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for various uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes for daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal personalized blanket for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from Polyester fabric for a lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care Instructions:</strong> Hand Wash Only for easy maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
